  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Mapper alignments with the rebuilt mart and the DDS output:\n\t\t  - AllergyIntolerance: onset prefers the clinical effective date, and coded allergies carry their SNOMED coding.\n\t\t  - Location: the type is filled from the type description, which previously could throw; the managing organisation carries its ODS identifier and display; empty addresses are omitted.\n\t\t  - Observation: the code uses SNOMED coding instead of a concept-table GUID, and the quantity no longer uses a GUID as its unit.\n\t\t  - FamilyMemberHistory: emits the CareConnect Recorder extension.\n\t\t  - Build: releases are now tagged with the workflow GITHUB_TOKEN and published using NuGet Trusted Publishing, via ADotNet 6.0.0.",
